  <arrangement id="ec4ddb1ff03e4707aa02961b8d068cda">
    <head>Arrangement</head>
<p>Arranged in 3 subseries: 1. Winthrop Rockefeller, 2. Winrock, 3. Winthrop Paul Rockefeller. Within each subseries, the material is in original order, as received.</p>  </arrangement>
  <scopecontent id="35b79f8a9180f8359533a6d0046599dd">
    <head>Scope and Contents</head>
<p>The William E. Davis photographs include portraits, candids and informal images of Winthrop Rockefeller and his immediate family, as well as Winthrop Paul Rockefeller and his immediate family. There is a small selection of images of conferences attended by Winthrop Rockefeller. The collection also contains extensive images of Winrock Farms including buildings, crops, employeees, parties, and cattle sales and receptions.</p>  </scopecontent>
